\fs64 \cf2 2. Get a reference to the GPU device\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/gpu/host/device_context/DeviceContext/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb13 \ul \ulc5 DeviceContext}} type represents a logical instance of a GPU device. It provides methods for allocating memory on the device, copying data between the host CPU and the GPU, and compiling and running functions (also known as kernels) on the device.\
Use the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/gpu/host/device_context/DeviceContext/#__init__"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb13 \ul \ulc5 DeviceContext()}} constructor to get a reference to the GPU device. The constructor raises an error if no compatible GPU is available. You can use the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/sys/info/has_accelerator/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb13 \ul \ulc5 has_accelerator()}} function to check if a compatible GPU is available.\
Let's start by writing a program that checks if a GPU is available and then obtains a reference to the GPU device. Using any editor, create a file named 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb13 vector_addition.mojo
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  with the following code:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14400 \cf16 \cb22 vector_addition.mojo\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf5 \cb15 from\cf16  std\cf5 .\cf16 gpu\cf5 .\cf16 host \cf5 import\cf16  DeviceContext\cb1 \
\cf5 \cb15 from\cf16  std\cf5 .\cf16 sys \cf5 import\cf16  has_accelerator\cb1 \
\
\cf5 \cb15 def\cf16  \cf14 main\cf5 ()\cf16  raises\cf5 :\cf16 \cb1 \
\cb15     \cf5 comptime\cf16  \cf5 if\cf16  \cf5 not\cf16  has_accelerator\cf5 ():\cf16 \cb1 \
\cb15         \cf5 print(\cf23 "No compatible GPU found"\cf5 )\cf16 \cb1 \
\cb15     \cf5 else:\cf16 \cb1 \
\cb15         ctx \cf5 =\cf16  DeviceContext\cf5 ()\cf16 \cb1 \
\cb15         \cf5 print(\cf23 "Found GPU:"\cf5 ,\cf16  ctx\cf5 .\cf16 name\cf5 ())\cf16 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf18 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf19 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
